es":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"JbxOWK2tMUkNmYPvjPBVoA","review_id":"NltxlD2tX_q98qByKAmvjA","date":"2018-09-11T01:36:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9239240288734436,"text_excerpt":"Not much to look at...But this is the place I most look forward to when planning a trip to New Orleans. I have to stay away during the daytime and save KK for the end or else I would be there 12 hours a day. It can be frustrating to get a bartender when it's crowded. But have patience because that is when it is the most fun. The band is so good and fun (and nice to look at). The bathroom is um, shall we say \"outdated?\" But again, this place is not there for looks. Go and dance with your fellow revelers, drink up, and tip the band for they are worthy :)"},{"business_id":"JbxOWK2tMUkNmYPvjPBVoA","review_id":"08ncT3KAjlAOTIYMGizaEg","date":"2012-05-28T15:51:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9213030338287354,"text_excerpt":"Fun spot! Live cover band is actually GOOD. Classic rock all night long. Bartenders weren't the friendliest, but the shot girls (at least a couple of them) were super sweet and lots of fun. If you're done walking the strip, park it here for some good tunes."},{"business_id":"JbxOWK2tMUkNmYPvjPBVoA","review_id":"y2TH7OnQJxWv7aZek1mmwQ","date":"2016-11-15T21:31:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9177933931350708,"text_excerpt":"It's a Bourbon Street bar, so, if you go, expect it to be one. An establishment with a quasi interested bartender serving drinks in plastic cups. So why five stars? The music! Great zydeco music in the center of the French Quarter. The band is entertaining, talented, and engaging with their audience. My wife and her friend were invited up on stage to play the \"washboard\" with the band. They each stole the show but the band did a great job keeping up. If you want to go and have some fun in a nonjudgemental atmosphere, the crowd and the musicians on stage will support you in letting your hair down. We stop in every time we are in from Chicago and we always enjoy the place."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"JbxOWK2tMUkNmYPvjPBVoA","photo_id":"jimHyXFkrXZYNQ4TPaRHLg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/jimHyXFkrXZYNQ4TPaRHLg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9031733274459839},{"business_id":"JbxOWK2tMUkNmYPvjPBVoA","photo_id":"nV6UkoKynsHKhzUmT0mo3Q","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/nV6UkoKynsHKhzUmT0mo3Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8674113750457764},{"business_id":"JbxOWK2tMUkNmYPvjPBVoA","photo_id":"CiVdVISzP8pEH7P_Qs6H_w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/CiVdVISzP8pEH7P_Qs6H_w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8512325286865234},{"business_id":"JbxOWK2tMUkNmYPvjPBVoA","photo_id":"C6cz3MVDDBDvC13i8E7_jw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/C6cz3MVDDBDvC13i8E7_jw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8451001644134521},{"business_id":"JbxOWK2tMUkNmYPvjPBVoA","photo_id":"OucL9CMiDAoMXiCSzAEBrg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/OucL9CMiDAoMXiCSzAEBrg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8345845937728882}]},"notebook_case":null}
